<title>HONG KONG: Jusco Stores 1996/97 net rises 10.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Jusco Stores 1996/97 net rises 10.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended February 28</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   24.23	vs  22.00</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    7.0	  vs  6.6</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  13.46 loss vs  5.43 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    63.01	vs  57.20</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,053.34   vs  1,584.92</p>
<p>    Company name		 Jusco Stores (Hong Kong) Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 3-10</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   August 8</p>
<p>NOTE - Jusco Stores (Hong Kong) is an operator of department stores.</p>
<p>The exceptional items represent pre-operating expenses written off.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 10.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 3.5 cents) vs 9.6 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
